{"title":"1996 IMO Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_IMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/f/b2f9543229ecb2ffcede3775f96f9de55b5492bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p, q, n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" /> be three positive integers with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/a/8fa0677036e16363fd2e002f0e0e134d0e710885.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q&lt;n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/7/d67607afc34735a1289450b7c2ffdad651caaee1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x_0,x_1,\\cdots ,x_n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"123\" height=\"20\" /> be an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/c/99cb3f3a8b3bbfc702c5863d16602a06cded535d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" />-tuple of integers satisfying the following conditions:\n</p><p>(i) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/4/9846f57158e39bc4c966266b0cd5eac309dda3fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_0=x_n=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"17\" />;\n</p><p>(ii) For each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/d/3fd77e67d5e894bf1026f4cffd551f2856f52af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\le i \\le n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />, either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/f/2df494c8387fa66128e66d85a679159b8475a1a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_i-x_{i-1}=p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/5/8d56c1424220c74e7b0c8a25cd3d3a91922bf8d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_i-x_{i-1}=-q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Show that there exists indices <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/8/4c8b76bca5358138116d4d962e20e582bfa708b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i&lt;j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"41\" height=\"17\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/4/2e48178aa489d4b0f872c6a72fa77d56fc64e28c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(i,j) \\ne (0,n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"105\" height=\"20\" />, such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/f/16f31223ddc05eafff86941df2691c6b6eea849f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_i=x_j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_IMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1996_IMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_IMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_IMO\" title=\"1996 IMO\">1996 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1996 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1996 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1996 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1996 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1996 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1996 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1996 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017185958\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 100/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1288/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 50/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\n